"Walidacja wymaga Javy (Temurin JRE 17+) oraz epubcheck.jar.\n"
"1. Zainstaluj Temurin: https://adoptium.net/\n"
"2. Pobierz epubcheck-5.x: https://github.com/w3c/epubcheck/releases\n"
"3. Rozpakuj jar do <config>/epubcheck/epubcheck.jar lub wskaż go w GUI."
msgstr ""
"Validation requires Java (Temurin JRE 17+) and epubcheck.jar.\n"
"1. Install Temurin: https://adoptium.net/\n"
"2. Download epubcheck-5.x: https://github.com/w3c/epubcheck/releases\n"
"3. Unpack the jar to <config>/epubcheck/epubcheck.jar or point to it in "
"the GUI."

